            <description><![CDATA[<p>Fixed an issue where toggling off &#39;Manage charging&#39; during a forced discharge failed to re-enable the power adapter.</p>
<h3>Bug Fixes &amp; Refinements</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Charging Controls:</strong> Ensure the power adapter is properly re-enabled when turning off charge management so native macOS charging resumes immediately.</li>
</ul>

]]></description>
